# The build context is web/. COPY . . must not drag the host's node_modules
# (whatever version set happens to be installed locally) over the image's
# fresh `npm ci`; a stale host jiti 1.x once shadowed the 2.x the lockfile
# pins and broke `vite build` only inside Docker.
node_modules
dist
coverage
.vite
npm-debug.log*
*.log
.env
.env.*
